  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197388",
      "title": "Making Items Deletable & Using IDs",
      "lectureOrder": 31,
      "videoOrder": 28,
      "sourceHash": "04c043dbab6e096a64108319afaaabd6c092feeb2b9c0f135801fb86d20f8c6a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 2.98,
          "en": "As a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.98,
          "end": 7.45,
          "en": "we can now make sure that an item actually does get deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.45,
          "end": 9.38,
          "en": "And for this, in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.38,
          "end": 11.33,
          "en": "in the deleteGoalHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.33,
          "end": 15.27,
          "en": "it would be convenient if in this handler function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.27,
          "end": 19.37,
          "en": "we would receive the ID of the to be deleted item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.37,
          "end": 21.9,
          "en": "Because that allows us to uniquely identify",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.9,
          "end": 23.313,
          "en": "and remove an item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.96,
          "end": 26.81,
          "en": "So here in this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.81,
          "end": 28.99,
          "en": "we could then set our course goals again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.99,
          "end": 31.84,
          "en": "to update this course goals state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.84,
          "end": 35.34,
          "en": "And now the new state should be based on the old state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 38.3,
          "en": "where we wanna take the old state, but remove a item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.3,
          "end": 40.37,
          "en": "and therefore we pass a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.37,
          "end": 42.39,
          "en": "to this state updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.39,
          "end": 44.2,
          "en": "'Cause that's how we should update state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.2,
          "end": 47.033,
          "en": "in React if it's based on the previous state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.18,
          "end": 50.89,
          "en": "So here, I again, get my current course goals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.89,
          "end": 53.47,
          "en": "as I did here, when we added a goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55,
          "end": 57.95,
          "en": "and I return the updated state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.95,
          "end": 61.4,
          "en": "And the updated state which I return is current course goals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.4,
          "end": 63.363,
          "en": "which is in Array, dot filter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.84,
          "end": 68.1,
          "en": "Filter is a built-in method in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 70.84,
          "en": "just as map was built-in method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.84,
          "end": 72.793,
          "en": "which we can call on in Array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.7,
          "end": 77.71000000000001,
          "en": "And filter will return a new Array, which is the old Array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.71000000000001,
          "end": 81.22,
          "en": "minus all the items we filtered out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.22,
          "end": 83.64,
          "en": "Now filter itself takes a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.64,
          "end": 85.85,
          "en": "which has to return true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.85,
          "end": 89.5,
          "en": "and if this inner function returns true, an item is kept,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.5,
          "end": 92.203,
          "en": "if it returns false, our item is dropped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.61,
          "end": 97.41,
          "en": "Now this inner function is executed by JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.41,
          "end": 100.2,
          "en": "for every item in this array and therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.2,
          "end": 103.92,
          "en": "it receives these items as inputs, as parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.92,
          "end": 105.993,
          "en": "In my case, these individual goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.08,
          "end": 112.08,
          "en": "And I wanna return false, if my goal has this ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.95,
          "end": 116.1,
          "en": "So I will check if the goal ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.1,
          "end": 118.65,
          "en": "so this ID property on my goal object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.65,
          "end": 122.103,
          "en": "is not equal to the ID I'm receiving here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.46,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "This will return true if there is no match,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 128.42,
          "en": "which is good because I want to keep items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.42,
          "end": 132.56,
          "en": "where there is no match, but if there is a match,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.56,
          "end": 135.45,
          "en": "if a item has the idea I'm looking to remove,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.45,
          "end": 140.09,
          "en": "this will return false because then the IDs are equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.09,
          "end": 143.14,
          "en": "and then this item will be dropped and the new array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.14,
          "end": 145.75,
          "en": "will no longer contain it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.75,
          "end": 148.203,
          "en": "That's how we can delete a course goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.21,
          "end": 151.21,
          "en": "Of course, we have one problem though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.21,
          "end": 153.51,
          "en": "the ID which we expect to get here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.51,
          "end": 155.97,
          "en": "is currently not provided.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.97,
          "end": 159.69,
          "en": "In goal item, where I'm binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.69,
          "end": 164.453,
          "en": "on the lead item to onpress, onpress won't give me that ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.37,
          "end": 167.959,
          "en": "Now to make sure that idea is provided,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.959,
          "end": 171.7,
          "en": "we could, again, define a little helper function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.73,
          "end": 176.9,
          "en": "as we did it in goal input, where we added addGoalHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.9,
          "end": 180.08,
          "en": "where we then manually called the function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.08,
          "end": 181.79,
          "en": "and passed our own parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.74,
          "end": 185.21,
          "en": "and that would be absolutely fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.21,
          "end": 190.13,
          "en": "But alternatively, we can also call the built in bind method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.13,
          "end": 192.865,
          "en": "on the function which we get through that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.865,
          "end": 194.365,
          "en": "onDeleteItem prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.59,
          "end": 197.98,
          "en": "Bind is a standard JavaScript function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 197.98,
          "end": 201.32999999999998,
          "en": "which basically allows you pre-configure a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.32999999999998,
          "end": 203.083,
          "en": "for future execution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.24,
          "end": 207.07999999999998,
          "en": "Now, the first value you pass to bind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.07999999999998,
          "end": 211.22,
          "en": "sets the this keyword in the to be executed function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.22,
          "end": 213,
          "en": "and we don't care about that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213,
          "end": 216.87,
          "en": "so I'll just set it to this, but it doesn't matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.87,
          "end": 220.867,
          "en": "The second value, the second argument you pass to bind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.867,
          "end": 224.09,
          "en": "will be the first parameter received",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.09,
          "end": 226.61,
          "en": "by the to be called function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 226.61,
          "end": 229.82,
          "en": "And in my case, that should be the ID of the goal item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 229.82,
          "end": 231.36,
          "en": "that should be removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.36,
          "end": 234.04,
          "en": "So here I'll set this to props.id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.04,
          "end": 237.1,
          "en": "so that the ID which I get through props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.1,
          "end": 242.1,
          "en": "on this goal item component is sent as a parameter value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 242.24,
          "end": 244.2,
          "en": "queue the function that we receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.2,
          "end": 246.95,
          "en": "on this onDeleteItem prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 246.95,
          "end": 249.913,
          "en": "which is this delete goal handler function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 251.05,
          "end": 253.21,
          "en": "Of course, for this to work, we must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 253.21,
          "end": 257.603,
          "en": "that we do get an ID prop on the goal item component though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 258.51,
          "end": 260.37,
          "en": "And currently that's not the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 260.37,
          "end": 262.23,
          "en": "but we can update our code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 262.23,
          "end": 266.18,
          "en": "and make sure at an ID prop is set on goal item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 266.18,
          "end": 270.943,
          "en": "and that would be itemdata.item.id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 272.86,
          "end": 275.73,
          "en": "Now there would be other ways of solving this as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 275.73,
          "end": 279.58,
          "en": "but this will work and if we save this now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 279.58,
          "end": 282.76,
          "en": "and we tap a item, it is removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.76,
          "end": 287.62,
          "en": "So now I can add items, multiple items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 287.62,
          "end": 290.96,
          "en": "and I can then tap them to remove them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 290.96,
          "end": 293.29,
          "en": "By the way, you could also add validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 293.29,
          "end": 296.15999999999997,
          "en": "to make sure that empty items can't be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 296.15999999999997,
          "end": 300.6,
          "en": "but here I will not do that to keep this app a bit simpler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 300.6,
          "end": 303.03,
          "en": "But with that, we can remove items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 303.03,
          "end": 305.59,
          "en": "Now what's missing though, is some styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 305.59,
          "end": 307.63,
          "en": "some visual feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 307.63,
          "end": 309.99,
          "en": "At the moment, when I tap this item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 309.99,
          "end": 314.02,
          "en": "I get no visual feedback other than its disappearance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 314.02,
          "end": 316.08299999999997,
          "en": "So let's focus on the styling next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
